{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云拘睒毗或云憍賞彌中印度境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云優填或云鄔陀衍那此翻出受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此翻不動姓頗羅墯此翻㨗疾利根廣語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猛光王所治國名不見有翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具云摩竭提此\n翻善勝又翻無惱又翻不害中印度境"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具云頻婆娑羅此翻摸實又翻形牢又影堅又\n影勝又顏色端正又色像殊妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "象馬車步"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即摩竭國都城之名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音委竹名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即猛光也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "青蓮華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "紅蓮華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃蓮華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白蓮華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未見翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牸音字母獸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未見翻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻為文飾\n\n或翻離有無破我慢心南天竺婆羅門姓也十弟子中論義第一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音拱粗惡貌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合和音蛤賀翮音劾鳥之勁羽又云羽莖也即翅翼也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羖音古䍽羊也羝音低牡羊也善抵犎音封野牛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音控馬勒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "皮膚血肉筋脉骨髓肪膏腦膜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "髮毛爪齒\n眵淚涎唾屎尿垢汗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "肝膽腸胃脾腎心肺生藏熟藏赤痰\n白痰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一念佛二念法\n三念僧四念戒五念捨六念天七念出入息八念死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一脹想二壞想三血塗想四膿爛想\n五青瘀想六噉想七散想八骨想九燒想"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一無常想二苦想三無我想四食不淨想五一\n切世間不可樂想六死想七不淨想八斷想九離想十盡想"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一內有色相外觀色\n二內無色相外觀色三淨背捨身作證四虗空處背捨五識處背捨六不用處背捨七非有想非無想背\n捨八滅受想背捨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一內有色相外觀色少若好若醜是名勝知勝見二內有色相\n外觀色多三內無色相外觀色少四內無色相外觀色多五青勝處六黃勝處七赤勝處八白勝處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一青二黃三赤四白五地六水七火八風九空十識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漬。音恣。浸潤也。恬。音甜。安靜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鞘音笑刀室也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "筐音匡方筥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簏音〔塵〕竹高篋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音恣草名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音門撫摸也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0706001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0706001", "type": "orig", "text": "住疑往"}
{"id": null, "n": "0715001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0715001", "type": "orig", "text": "塵疑鹿"}
